{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9681344851626884826,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Pi from String Amplitudes",
      "source_hash": 15492032039475493270,
      "context_hash": 11364229233564828343,
      "translation": "끈 진폭에서 얻는 파이",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405747Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "From the [paper by Arnab Priya Saha and Aninda Sinha](https://journals.aps.org/prl/pdf/10.1103/PhysRevLett.132.221601).",
      "source_hash": 14039921113400430095,
      "context_hash": 7275692232502578026,
      "translation": "[Arnab Priya Saha와 Aninda Sinha의 논문](https://journals.aps.org/prl/pdf/10.1103/PhysRevLett.132.221601)에서 가져왔습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405748Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A new series for $\\pi$ and its convergence.",
      "source_hash": 9098464883393771880,
      "context_hash": 13556040230174743207,
      "translation": "$\\pi$에 대한 새로운 급수와 그 수렴성입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405748Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Where $(a)_{n-1}$ is the Pochhammer symbol.",
      "source_hash": 8492643197786571131,
      "context_hash": 3464274313636594825,
      "translation": "여기서 $(a)_{n-1}$는 포흐하머 기호입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405748Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "$\\lambda$ is a free parameter for optimizing convergence.",
      "source_hash": 9502725791404757760,
      "context_hash": 7809727141741985348,
      "translation": "$\\lambda$는 수렴을 최적화하기 위한 자유 매개변수입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "parameter": "매개변수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405749Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "As $\\lambda$ approaches infinity, the series reduces to the classic Madhava series.",
      "source_hash": 8964011806655603704,
      "context_hash": 103699294920824299,
      "translation": "$\\lambda$가 무한대로 가면 이 급수는 고전적인 마다바 급수가 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405749Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "With $\\lambda$ between 10 and 100, the series takes 30 terms to converge to ten decimal places.",
      "source_hash": 13431680858910321563,
      "context_hash": 9320793366754021196,
      "translation": "$\\lambda$가 10에서 100 사이이면 이 급수는 30개 항만으로 소수점 이하 열 자리까지 수렴합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405749Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:3",
      "source": "Which is far more efficient than the classic [Madhava series](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Madhava_series), which takes 5 billion terms to converge to ten decimal places.",
      "source_hash": 1451881326523682156,
      "context_hash": 10735179268310673098,
      "translation": "이는 소수점 이하 열 자리까지 수렴하는 데 50억 개의 항이 필요한 고전적인 [마다바 급수](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Madhava_series)보다 훨씬 효율적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405749Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "This can be implemented in Python as follows:",
      "source_hash": 12455233382862383231,
      "context_hash": 17750767443764188541,
      "translation": "이는 Python으로 다음과 같이 구현할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Python": "Python"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:20:16.405749Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}